   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Present tense endings in -are",
     "texto": [
      "To conjugate a verb ending in **-are**, you remove the infinitive ending and add the personal endings: **io -o**, **tu -i**, **lui/lei/Lei -a**, **noi -iamo**, **voi -ate**, **loro -ano**.",
      "Two key details: the **tu** form always ends in **-i** (never *-as*), and in the **loro** form the stress moves back to the stem, making it a word stressed on the third-last syllable: **PAR-la-no**, **A-bi-ta-no**, **AS-col-ta-no**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
